# 统一行尾，避免 Windows/Linux 拉下来整片 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 这些保持二进制，不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.pt binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary

# 中文文件名在某些工具里容易出问题，明确标记
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
